      "dcterms:title": "Primers, Probe and encapsidated RNA pos. control - SARS-CoV-2 RdRp gene, medium packaging",
      "dcterms:description": "Lyophilized encapsidated RNA for SARS-CoV-2  real time RT-PCR targeting region of the RdRp (Wuhan/CUB)  gene (for 100 Rxns in the form of 4x 25 rnxs) AND Lyophilized  ready-to-use primers and probe (Lyoph-P&P) for real time RT-PCR (96 rxns in the form of 12x8 rnxs). \r\nTarget, primers and probe designed by CUB Berlin. \r\nSOPs in the attached pdf.\r\nDisclaimer: This product does not contain the polymerase",
      "EVORAO:unitDefinition": "16 vials",
