      "search:sku": "007V-04775",
      "search:title": "SARS-CoV-2 clone, Wuhan with S-Gene of Omicron BA.5",
      "search:description": "Virus was produced from plasmid-based DNA segments of a common Wuhan strain. The S-gene was site-specifically replaced with a cloned BA.5-based S-gene sequence. S carries these mutations: T19I; LPPA24-27S; Del 69-70; G142D; V213G; G339D; S371F; S373P; S375F",
