      "dcterms:description": "Human monoclonal recombinant IgG1 targeting the S1 domain of SARS-CoV-2 Spike as determined by ELISA.",
      "EVORAO:unitDefinition": "1 vial, ~250 µL, 68,6 µg/mL, 17,2 µg",
      "EVORAO:category": {
