      "dcterms:title": "Anti-Puumala orthohantavirus monoclonal antibody (3B12C1)",
      "dcterms:description": "Recombinant monoclonal antibody directed against the glycoprotein precursor of Puumala orthohantavirus (antigen: recombinant VLPS expressing the PUUV GPC of the strain Astrup). The recombinant antibody is expressed in Expi293 cells and Streptactin-purified from the cell culture supernatant. The antibody is available as mouse IgG1/k, mouse IgG2a/k, rabbit IgG1/k, human IgG1/k, bovine IgG/k, porcine IgG/k as well as human IgG1/k fused to the Venus fluorophore. Delivery time will be dependent on the selected species.",
