      "search:sku": "006V-04753",
      "search:title": "SARS-CoV-2 strain Slovakia/SK-BMC-BA43/2022- Omicron VOC BE.1.1 (alias BA.5.3.1.1.1.)",
      "search:description": "This SARS-CoV-2 strain was isolated from a COVID-19 patient from Slovakia in July 2022. The virus belongs to the BE.1.1 lineage (alias of BA.5.3.1.1.1; Omicron VOC). The virus is  preserved under Viral Storage Medium -80C. Tests for the presence of mycoplasmae were negative. To confirm its identity the virus has been fully sequenced.",
