      "EVORAO:regionEncompassedInThisProduct": "Ebola virus NP, VP35, VP30, L, VP40, VP24 open reading frames, Lloviu virus GP1,2 open reading frame, Ebola virus terminal leader and trailer regions, selected Ebola virus untranslated/non-coding regions (NP/VP35, VP40/GP, VP30/VP24), Nano and firefly luciferase open reading frames, T7 RNA polymerase open reading frame (codon optimized), and Tim1 open reading frame (codon optimized)",
